#: src/modes/xorg/xorgLogMode.cpp:48
msgid "Display the X.org log."
msgstr "Dat X.org-Logbook wiesen"

#: src/modes/xorg/xorgLogMode.cpp:49
msgid ""
"Displays the X.org log in the current tab. X.org is the service which "
"displays on screen your desktop and manage your graphical hardware. See this "
"log if you want to know why you do not have 3D accelerations or why your "
"input device is not recognized."
msgstr "Wiest dat X.org-Logbook binnen dat aktuelle Paneel. \"X.org\" is de Deenst, de Dien Schriefdisch op den Schirm wiest un Dien Grafik-Hardware pleegt. Kiek Di dit Logbook an, wenn Du weten wullt, worüm Du keen 3D-Beslünigen hest oder Dien Ingaavreedschap sik nich finnen lett."

#: src/modes/acpid/acpidLogMode.cpp:39
msgid "ACPI Log"
msgstr "ACPI-Logbook"

#: src/modes/acpid/acpidLogMode.cpp:48
msgid "Display the ACPI log."
msgstr "Dat ACPI-Logbook wiesen"

#: src/modes/acpid/acpidLogMode.cpp:49
msgid ""
"Displays the ACPI log in the current tab. ACPI is used to manage the "
"hardware components of your computer, like notebook batteries, reset "
"buttons..."
msgstr "Wiest dat ACPI-Logbook (engl. »Advanced Configuration and Power Management Interface«, Verwiedert Koppelsteed för Instellen un Stroomsporen). De ACP-Koppelsteed pleegt Hardware-Delen vun Dien Reekner as Klappreekner-Batterien oder Niegstart-Knööp."

#: src/modes/samba/sambaAccessLogMode.cpp:40
msgid "Samba Access Log"
msgstr "Samba-Togriep-Logbook"

#: src/modes/samba/sambaAccessLogMode.cpp:48
msgid "Display the Samba Access log."
msgstr "Samba sien Togriep-Logbook wiesen"

#: src/modes/samba/sambaAccessLogMode.cpp:49
msgid ""
"Displays the Samba Access log in the current tab. This log mode allows you "
"to see connections between your shares and remote hosts."
msgstr "Wiest Samba sien Togriep-Logbook binnen dat aktuelle Paneel. Binnen dit Logbook kannst Du de Verbinnen twischen Dien Freegaven un anner Reekners bekieken."

#: src/modes/samba/sambaLogMode.cpp:40
